  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Tax 102.21 “Eminent Domain proceeding” means any condemnation action filed with the board under RSA 498-A.\n\nSource. #7152, eff 12-10-99 (formerly Tax 101.19); ss by 8985, eff 9-24-07 (from Tax 102.21); ss by #10623, eff 6-26-14 (from Tax 102.23); ss by 13686, eff 7-19-23",
